Prerequisite: log in first and store the session cookie in $env:TEMP\expressbookreviews-user-one.cookies.

Command (PowerShell):
curl.exe -i -X PUT "http://localhost:5000/customer/auth/review/1?review=First%20review" -b "$env:TEMP\expressbookreviews-user-one.cookies" -c "$env:TEMP\expressbookreviews-user-one.cookies"

Output (HTTP 200):
{"message":"Review added or updated successfully."}
